		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="13182"></a><b>MorelenSK</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Guest<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13182&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13182"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Dec 03, 2001 10:08 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13182&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">
<br />

<br />
 *Laughs without humor*
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   You are correct, Sundered, we are not so different in our views.  I have often said we are mirrors to one another. It is not so strange that we would see our endless strugle through similar eyes.  We are our gods creations after all.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   I must say I wonder what there is in you that is not in me. How were you able to cross the gulf of twilight from the darkness of you birth and to the &quot;light&quot; where you now dwell. 
<br />

<br />
How am I with my blood tainted with that of Tunare's children so much more a child of Innoruuk then you?  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
     I am sure Oathtender and your new husband will say it courage that I lack, but I do not believe that to be the case.  There are those among my own kind who will say that because I ask such questions I show the weakness of my blood.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   *shrugs*
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
    Perhaps that is why I am more the Prince of Hate's creature then you, Reis. I am to much a child of hate to live in the light and to tainted to dwell fully in the darkness.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
    Morelen Despyte
<br />

<br />
    Shadow Knight of Hate
<br />

<br />
    House of Dread 
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
