		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13185&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13185"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Dec 06, 2001 7:53 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13185&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Reis laughs softly to herself in the silence, then speaks in a soft voice:
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Questions are my enemy, for my questions explode! Answers darken the sky light flights of bats, yet one, not one, will suffice.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
She smiles a thin smile, reflecting on lessons hard learned and speaks again.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Escuse me for ranting.. i've yet to encounter a single person who speaks of such thingsg besides me.&quot; 
<br />
<i>You know your never sure
<br />

<br />
But your sure you could be right
<br />

<br />
If you held yourself up to the light</i><i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
