		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13186&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13186"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Dec 06, 2001 8:58 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13186&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Rithnok smiles a sly smile as he turns an opalessent eye upon Reis, &quot;Nothing to excuse m'lady, Especially not from one who understands the black wind that follows those like myself.&quot; he smiles and makes a quote as he looks slightly skyward, &quot;The light my closest friend, the darkness, my blanket of comfort. The howling screams of the night wind play soft melodies within my mind. These are the things that are me. These are the things I do not wish to see.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
He smiles again... &quot;Some may not understand... But others understand all too well.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
