		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="13187"></a><b>MorelenSK</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Guest<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13187&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13187"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Fri Dec 07, 2001 5:11 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13187&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">
<br />

<br />
     I can see why you no longer live amoung the Teir'Dal, Reis.  Thoughts such as those lead to short lives amoung our people.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
      I wonder how you found the time to search for such answers amoung our people.  I have always been to busy just trying to survive.  If our people have an art it is just that survival we have made the game of life and death an art form.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
      I do find these philosphical discussions interesting it always gives me something to think over.  Once again I see that there is more to one of you then I thought.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
      Since we must be enemies it as least good that I can respect you as my enemies.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
       Morelen Despyte
<br />

<br />
       Shadow Knight of Hate
<br />

<br />
       House of Dread
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
      
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
