			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13191&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13191"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Dec 10, 2001 4:40 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13191&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">
<br />

<br />
  Morelen's violet eyes widen as she takes an involuntary step away from Reis.  She stares for a long moment at the offered hand as if trying to understand its meaning.  A hundred scenerios of betrayal and subterfuge flash through her mind reflected in her eyes.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   She opens her mouth to speak but her voice seems lost to her.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   She takes a deep breath her emotionaless mask returning to her face.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   &quot;I am not sure what is more distrubing to me, the fact that you mean your offer or the fact I find myself tempted to accept.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   &quot;Why must we be enemies?  In part because my life is not my own.  I am bound by blood and honor to the will of my father.  His will and his aims will evetually bring me to cross swords with you and yours.  Even should that not be the case, my goals and Concordat will eventually collide.  I wil make no pretense of that.  There will come a time when I will make war on those who you will seek to protect.  My reasons will not be what you might think, but that time will come.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
     &quot;I can not take your hand, Reis, no matter how much I may or may not wish to because in the end I would have to betray you.  The only thing I have in all  this world that is truly mine is my honor and will not part with it so.&quot; 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
    
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
