		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13192&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13192"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Dec 10, 2001 9:06 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13192&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Morelen, if you walk away from Reis's offer, you only betray yourself. Have the courage Morelen, who knows you may help lead your entire House to a new understanding, a new hope, and a new peace. Places his hand on Reis's shoulder and smiles at his love. Caelyn was right dear, you undo many things... a very many things... 
<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />Parnhamien Tor'Dainal
<br />
Paladin of Marr
<br />
Elder Concordat Angelis</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
