		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13193&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13193"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Dec 10, 2001 8:46 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13193&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Reis's red eyes focus on Morelen with a calm intensity, she lets her outstretched hand fall back to her side.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Why must we be enemys? No one can take your life. Your will, your mind, your body, your soul- all are ultimatly yours and yours alone. I understand honor.. I would not have you break it, or change your goals, whatever they may be. If they are changed, it will be because you decide it is for your own good. I have friends amoung the followers of Innoruuk, and while thier goals might conflict with mine or the Concordat, we have remained friends.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;And what if you did betray me? Just such a offer of no-strings-attached friendship is asking for betrayal enough. My father would no doubt love to see me dead, and he is a necromancer of fairly high rank, so last i've heard. My offer remains, and it will remain. If you feel you must accept, then do so. If you feel you must not, then don't. If your mind changes, I will listen.&quot; 
<br />
<i>You know your never sure
<br />

<br />
But your sure you could be right
<br />

<br />
If you held yourself up to the light</i><i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
