		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="13194"></a><b>MorelenSK</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Guest<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13194&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13194"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Dec 12, 2001 11:34 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13194&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">
<br />

<br />
  &quot;Your father is among the Lords of the Dead?&quot; Morelen ask shaking her head slowly.  &quot;Then a friendship with me is not something you would wish for.  The High elf blood in my veins causes them to watch me closely, many do not belive I follow the teachings of Innoruuk as well as I should.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   &quot;They are probably right.&quot; Morelen smiles slightly. 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
   &quot;I will not call you friend yet, Reis, for your sake as well as mine.  I will not count you among my enemies either.  You need never fear my sword being raised against you.  I can make no promises for the rest of Concordat.&quot;   
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
