		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="13195"></a><b>Reis</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Guest<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13195&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8#13195"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Dec 13, 2001 7:52 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13195&amp;sid=8f91c21c5a7fce9c65085f4c95cba1e8"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">&quot;Draven Chere.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Reis pauses a moment.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;He exiled me from the family long ago when I was a child and now he is of no real consiquence to me. If one wanted a definition for the word failure, one would find he is a good place to start the search.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
She flashes a taught, mischif filled grin for a moment.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Apparently they are right. But the mind that wanders eventually finds it wanders to greater things. Maybe that is why Neriak collectivly tries to crush any magic but necromancy and the clerics?&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;A truce, then. I can certanly understand why; thier have been several moments that I have concidered ending members of the Concordat as well. The Concordat is a good thing, but little is more annoying than people who belive they know everything and people who truly blind idiots.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
She grins.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Unfortunatly I seem to be surrounded by barbarians who know everything and rangers who dont recognise Karana. But that is beside the point. A truce is good. I will keep myself from your busness, then. And that acctualy may not be nessisary.. I have thought of returning to Neriak recently, when I can break the magics that keep me away from Norrath.&quot;  
<br />
<i>You know your never sure
<br />
But your sure you could be right
<br />
If you held yourself up to the light
<br />
</i>
<br />

<br />
(Dark Elven Enchanteress)<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
